      <div class="about-body">
        <p>I spent more than 20 years working in corporate environments before building and running my own businesses. I've seen how much difference good systems can make, and how frustrating technology becomes when it creates more work than it saves.</p>
        <p>Alongside my consultancy work, I manage business operations, develop workflows and work on digital systems within my own businesses. That means I understand both the technology and the realities of running a business.</p>
        <p>I enjoy getting into the detail, asking the questions that matter and finding an approach that makes sense for the people who'll actually use it.</p>
        <blockquote>This is my why. I love seeing a business skyrocket the moment I remove the tech blockers holding it back.</blockquote>
        <p>You don't need to arrive knowing which software you want or exactly how to solve the problem. That's part of what we can work out together.</p>
      </div>
